{
  "key": 18215,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_GymClosedWonderWhoLeaderIs",
      "en_US": [
        "This Pokémon Gym is always closed.\r",
        "I wonder who the Leader is?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_GoShoppingInPewterOccasionally",
      "en_US": [
        "I go shopping in Pewter City\n",
        "occasionally.\r",
        "I have to take the winding trail in\n",
        "Viridian Forest when I go."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_WantToKnowAboutCaterpillarMons",
      "en_US": [
        "You want to know about the two\n",
        "kinds of caterpillar Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_CanCarryMonsAnywhere",
      "en_US": [
        "Those Poké Balls at your waist!\n",
        "You have Pokémon, don’t you?\r",
        "It’s great that you can carry and\n",
        "use Pokémon anytime, anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_CatchMonsForEasierBattles",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Catch Pokémon and expand your\n",
        "collection.\r",
        "The more you have, the easier it\n",
        "is to battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_GymSign",
      "en_US": "Viridian City Pokémon Gym"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_MovesLimitedByPP",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "The battle moves of Pokémon are\n",
        "limited by their Power Points, PP.\r",
        "To replenish PP, rest your tired\n",
        "Pokémon at a Pokémon Center."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_CitySign",
      "en_US": [
        "Viridian City \n",
        "The Eternally Green Paradise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_GymDoorsAreLocked",
      "en_US": "Viridian Gym’s doors are locked…"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Route2_Text_RouteSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Route 2\n",
        "Viridian City - Pewter City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_ThisIsPrivateProperty",
      "en_US": [
        "I absolutely forbid you from\n",
        "going through here!\r",
        "This is private property!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_ViridiansGymLeaderReturned",
      "en_US": "Viridian Gym’s Leader returned!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_HowsTeachyTVHelping",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, now, I’ve had my coffee, and\n",
        "that’s what I need to get going!\r",
        "But I made it too strong.\n",
        "It gave me a headache…\r",
        "Incidentally, is my old Teachy TV\n",
        "helping you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_MyGrandsonOnTheShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Wahaha!\n",
        "It’s my grandson on the show!\r",
        "Since he’s the one doing the\n",
        "teaching, you’re bound to learn."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, now, I’ve had my coffee, and\n",
        "that’s what I need to get going!\r",
        "But I made it too strong.\n",
        "It gave me a headache…\r",
        "Incidentally, are you filling your\n",
        "Pokédex?\r",
        "At first, focus on weakening the\n",
        "Pokémon before trying to catch it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_GrandpaHasntHadCoffeeYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, Grandpa!\n",
        "Don’t be so mean!\r",
        "I’m so sorry.\n",
        "He hasn’t had his coffee yet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_ExplainCaterpieWeedle",
      "en_US": [
        "Caterpie has no poison,\n",
        "but Weedle does.\r",
        "Watch that your Pokémon aren’t\n",
        "stabbed by Weedle’s Poison Sting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_OhOkayThen",
      "en_US": "Oh, okay then!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouHowToCatchMons",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, now, I’ve had my coffee, and\n",
        "that’s what I need to get going!\r",
        "Hm?\n",
        "What is that red box you have?\r",
        "Ah, so you’re working on your\n",
        "Pokédex.\r",
        "Then let me give you a word of\n",
        "advice.\r",
        "Whenever you catch a Pokémon,\n",
        "the Pokédex automatically updates\f",
        "its data.\r",
        "…You don’t know how to catch\n",
        "a Pokémon?\r",
        "I suppose I had better show you\n",
        "then!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_ThatWasEducationalTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "There! Now tell me, that was\n",
        "educational, was it not?\r",
        "And here, take this, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_WatchThatToLearnBasics",
      "en_US": [
        "If there’s something you don’t\n",
        "understand, watch that.\r",
        "It will teach you about the basics\n",
        "of being a Pokémon Trainer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Route22_Text_EarlyRivalIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "You’re off to the Pokémon League?\n",
        "Forget about it!\r",
        "You probably don’t have any\n",
        "Badges, do you?\r",
        "The guard won’t let you through\n",
        "without them.\r",
        "By the way, did your Pokémon get\n",
        "any stronger?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Route22_Text_EarlyRivalPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard the Pokémon League is\n",
        "crawling with tough Trainers.\r",
        "I have to figure out how to get\n",
        "past them.\r",
        "You should quit dawdling and get a\n",
        "move on!\r",
        "And forget about the Pallet Gym.\n",
        "That one’s Mine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Route22_Text_LateRivalIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: What? {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "What a surprise to see you here!\r",
        "So you’re going to the Pokémon\n",
        "League?\r",
        "You collected all the Badges, too?\n",
        "And all the approvals? That’s cool!\r",
        "But only one of us gets the Pallet\n",
        "Gym.\r",
        "Then I’ll whip you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, as a\n",
        "warm-up for the Pokémon League!\r",
        "Come on!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Route22_Text_LateRivalPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "That loosened me up.\n",
        "I’m ready for the Pokémon League!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, you need more practice.\r",
        "Only one of us is coming home as\n",
        "a Leader. And it’s gonna be me!\r",
        "I’m out of here. Smell ya!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_TooBusyForTeachyTV",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm… You’re too busy to not even\n",
        "have the time for Teachy TV…\r",
        "Time is money, and neither should\n",
        "be ill spent…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Shall I show you how to catch\n",
        "a Pokémon again?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_ViridianCity_Text_ThereThatsHowItsDone",
      "en_US": "There! That’s how it’s done."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMove",
      "en_US": "Which move should I teach?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMon",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon should learn\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_TypeTutor_Text_Taught",
      "en_US": "Well done! Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_MoveExtractor_Text_SecondVisit",
      "en_US": [
        "Psst! Kid! It’s me, from Nugget\n",
        "Bridge!\r",
        "You… you beat the Boss at Silph\n",
        "Co.?! And I recommended you!\r",
        "I’m in so much trouble…\r",
        "…But you know what? I heard the\n",
        "Boss say “That child has talent.”\r",
        "So he’s not mad. I think.\n",
        "Here. Keep stealing moves!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_MoveExtractor_Text_SecondVisitAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "Lay low for a while, OK?\n",
        "I’ll find you again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_MoveExtractor_Text_ThirdVisit",
      "en_US": [
        "Kid… it’s over.\n",
        "The Boss is gone.\r",
        "No higher-ups. No recommendation.\n",
        "Sorry, kid.\r",
        "…Funny thing is, I don’t even mind.\r",
        "You’re going to be a Gym Leader,\n",
        "right? Take the last one.\r",
        "Make your Gym the toughest in\n",
        "Kanto with it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_MoveExtractor_Text_ThirdVisitAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "Maybe I’ll go straight.\n",
        "See you around, Leader."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_TypeTutor_Text_Bye",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time. A Leader\n",
        "never stops learning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Text_GymHack_WrongType",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: Only {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}-type\n",
        "Pokémon may be on your team.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type!\r",
        "Leave it in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Text_GymHack_Duplicate",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may be the same species.\r",
        "You have more than one\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Leave one in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_Text_GymHack_DuplicateItem",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may hold the same item.\r",
        "More than one is holding\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Take one off and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
